# `reporting/writeups/` — Internal reports and interpretation

## Authority

See the root [`README.md`](../../README.md), reporting
[`README.md`](../README.md), and [`AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md).

Use one folder per lab update, progress report, funder report, or internal
analysis summary, conventionally `YYYY-Qn-short-slug/` or
`YYYY-MM-short-slug/`. Mutable Markdown/LaTeX source may reference light data
figures from `results/figures/light/` and authored schematics from
`assets/figures/`.

`LAB_NOTEBOOK.md` is a special append-only human interpretation log keyed to
registered computational executions; it is not ordinary writeup source and does
not replace current/archived provenance.

When a writeup is distributed externally or used as a milestone record, create
an immutable delivery with the exact payload and figures. See
[`../DELIVERIES.md`](../DELIVERIES.md). If a writeup becomes a manuscript, create
the corresponding artifact under `papers/`; preserve its prior history.
